{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSRadioPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSRadioPicker","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSRadioPickerV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadioPicker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSRadioPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a custom radio trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPickerData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","level":2,"text":"Forbidden by design"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a read only state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"text":"Code samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in radio buttons using OUDSRadioPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the OUDSRadioItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional withdefault values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSRadioPickerData<String>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                        label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                        extraLabel: \"Very spicy\",","                                        description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                        image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","            OUDSRadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                        label: \"IPA beer\",","                                        description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                        image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","            OUDSRadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                        label: \"Mineral water\",","                                        image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: String = \"Choice_1\"","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical","    OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selection, radios: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horitzontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the radio buttons are in read-only mode and use a reversed layout.","    OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selection,","                    radios: someDataToPopulate,","                    isReversed: true,","                    isReadOnly: true,","                    placement: .horitzontal(true))"]},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one"}]},{"anchor":"Theme-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Theme rendering","level":2},{"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioPicker_Orange"}]},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioPicker_OrangeCompact"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioPicker_Sosh"}]},{"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioPicker_Wireframe"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.14.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsradiopicker"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several radio buttons and choose only one within the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each radio button contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose the choosen value through this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anc